# GEMINI Backup Archive (v4/v5)

This file contains historical reference rules from earlier iterations of NexusDB before v6.0.0 consolidation.

---

# System Enforcement

The Infinity Brain is a self-maintaining knowledge system. All policies described in this document should be enforced automatically through scripts, hooks, and agents.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Documentation is not the source of truth. **Automation is.**

---

# Single Sources of Truth

```
.antigravity/
├── rules/
│   ├── tag-schema.md          # All allowed tags
│   ├── promotion-rules.md     # Node promotion policy
│   ├── node-schema.md         # Atomic note structure
│   ├── moc-schema.md          # MOC structure
│   └── source-schema.md       # Source metadata
├── logs/
│   └── moc-health.md          # MOC and knowledge graph health reports
└── automations/               # Automation scripts
```

---

# Controlled Tag Schema

| Category | Allowed Tags | Description / Rule |
|---|---|---|
| **Source** | `#youtube`, `#podcast`, `#book`, `#article`, `#paper`, `#newletter`, `#substack` | Permanent source tags must never be removed. |
| **Knowledge Type** | `#concept`, `#fact`, `#principle`, `#framework`, `#workflow`, `#mental-model`, `#definition`, `#law`, `#question`, `#universal-truth` | Specifies cognitive type of note. |
| **Status** | `#processed`, `#draft`, `#evergreen` | Lifecycle stage. |
| **Domain** | `#ai`, `#ml`, `#psychology`, `#productivity` | Subject area. |

---

# Duplicate Prevention

1. Search Title
2. Search Aliases
3. Search Semantic Similarity
4. Search Backlinks

---

# Node Validation

- [ ] One Concept Only
- [ ] MOC Association
- [ ] Connected
- [ ] Sourced
- [ ] Valid Tags
- [ ] No Broken Links
